      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey i dont know if ur the right person to ask but i keep hearing this weird low hum lately. its like i can actually hear the electricity running through the walls of my apartment. it’s getting louder every day and it feels like it’s vibrating in my teeth or something. is that even normal??",
